    "# 📁 Notebook 07 — RSNA Data Preparation\n",
    "## FedMedSeg Phase 2: Semantic Segmentation\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook prepares the dataset for Phase 2 training.\n",
